---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "SEJ Auto Parts Case Study — B2B SEO & Technical Authority | SEO for Automotive";
const description = "How we helped SEJ Auto Parts achieve 350% more B2B leads, build technical SEO authority, and create a $1.8M organic pipeline through specialist B2B automotive SEO.";
const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Case Studies', href: '/case-studies/' },
  { label: 'SEJ Auto Parts', href: '/case-studies/sejautoparts/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/case-studies/sejautoparts/" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="badge-outline">Auto Parts (B2B)</span>
        <span class="kw-badge">B2B SEO</span>
        <span class="kw-badge">Technical</span>
        <span class="kw-badge">Leads</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
        SEJ Auto Parts: <span class="text-gradient-gold">B2B SEO & Technical Authority</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
        How we helped SEJ Auto Parts — a B2B auto parts supplier — achieve 350% more wholesale leads, build technical SEO authority, and create a $1.8M organic sales pipeline.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-10">
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-value">+350%</div><div class="metric-label">B2B Leads</div></div>
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-value">+280%</div><div class="metric-label">Organic Traffic</div></div>
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-value">$1.8M</div><div class="metric-label">Pipeline Value</div></div>
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-value">200+</div><div class="metric-label">Page 1 Keywords</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>About SEJ Auto Parts</h2>
      <p><strong>SEJ Auto Parts</strong> is a B2B auto parts supplier serving repair shops, fleet operators, dealer service departments, and wholesale distributors. Their catalog includes OEM-equivalent parts, aftermarket components, and specialty replacement parts across multiple vehicle categories.</p>

      <h2>The Challenge</h2>
      <p>SEJ Auto Parts had a solid product catalog but was struggling to reach B2B buyers through organic search:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>B2B search invisibility</strong> — ranking outside top 100 for commercial intent queries like "wholesale auto parts supplier," "bulk brake pads supplier," "OEM parts distributor"</li>
        <li><strong>Technical SEO debt</strong> — 15,000+ product pages with duplicate title tags, missing meta descriptions, and no structured data</li>
        <li><strong>No content differentiation</strong> — product pages were identical to manufacturer descriptions found on every competitor site</li>
        <li><strong>Lead generation dependency on trade shows and cold outreach</strong> — organic generated less than 5% of qualified wholesale leads</li>
        <li><strong>Competitor content gap</strong> — major distributors had technical resources, application guides, and part compatibility databases</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Strategy</h2>

      <h3>1. B2B Keyword & Intent Architecture</h3>
      <p>B2B auto parts SEO is fundamentally different from B2C — buyers use technical specifications, OEM part numbers, and commercial-intent modifiers. We built the strategy around three intent layers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Commercial intent pages</strong> — "wholesale [part type] supplier," "bulk [part] pricing," "[part] distributor"</li>
        <li><strong>Technical specification pages</strong> — OEM cross-references, part compatibility tables, technical specs by vehicle application</li>
        <li><strong>Application & comparison content</strong> — "OEM vs aftermarket [part]," "[part] for [vehicle make/model]," fitment guides</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2. Technical SEO Overhaul</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Deduplication at scale</strong> — consolidated 15,000 product pages to 8,500 unique, high-value pages with proper canonicalization</li>
        <li><strong>Product schema implementation</strong> — Product, Offer, and Organization schema across all product and category pages</li>
        <li><strong>Site architecture redesign</strong> — organized by vehicle application → part category → specific part, matching how B2B buyers search</li>
        <li><strong>Page speed optimization</strong> — reduced LCP from 5.1s to 2.0s through image optimization, lazy loading, and caching</li>
        <li><strong>XML sitemap restructure</strong> — priority-based sitemaps separating high-value product pages from thin filter pages</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3. B2B Content Authority</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Technical resource center</strong> — part compatibility databases, torque specifications, installation technical bulletins</li>
        <li><strong>Industry content</strong> — fleet maintenance guides, repair shop inventory management, wholesale buying guides</li>
        <li><strong>Cross-reference tools</strong> — OEM-to-aftermarket part number lookup pages targeting B2B research queries</li>
        <li><strong>Case studies and testimonials</strong> — social proof content showing fleet contracts, repair shop partnerships, and volume pricing</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>4. Lead Generation Optimization</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Wholesale inquiry forms</strong> on every category and high-traffic product page</li>
        <li><strong>Quote request CTAs</strong> contextually placed within product and comparison content</li>
        <li><strong>Account application funnel</strong> — streamlined B2B account creation for qualified leads</li>
        <li><strong>Email nurture sequences</strong> — lead capture for technical content downloads with automated follow-up</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Results (GSC, GA4, CRM Data)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>B2B wholesale leads increased 350%</strong> — from 24 to 108 qualified wholesale inquiries per month</li>
        <li><strong>Organic traffic grew 280%</strong> — from 4,200 to 15,960 monthly sessions (GA4)</li>
        <li><strong>$1.8M in attributable organic pipeline value</strong> — tracked from first organic touch to closed deal (CRM)</li>
        <li><strong>200+ keywords on page 1</strong> — including "wholesale auto parts," "bulk brake pads," "OEM parts supplier" (SEMrush)</li>
        <li><strong>Organic now generates 28% of all B2B leads</strong> — up from 5%</li>
        <li><strong>Average deal size from organic leads is 40% larger</strong> — higher-quality leads from search vs. cold outreach</li>
        <li><strong>Technical resource pages generate 45% of all organic traffic</strong> — building authority that lifts all product rankings</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>B2B auto parts SEO requires technical depth</strong> — specifications, compatibility data, and OEM cross-references are what B2B buyers search for</li>
        <li><strong>Deduplication before creation</strong> — removing low-value duplicate pages freed crawl budget for high-value content</li>
        <li><strong>Content authority drives product rankings</strong> — technical resources build topical authority that lifts all product pages</li>
        <li><strong>Organic B2B leads close at higher values</strong> — self-qualified buyers from search tend to place larger initial orders</li>
      </ol>

      <p><a href="/contact/">Want to build a B2B organic pipeline?</a> Let's discuss your B2B SEO strategy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel rounded-xl p-8 text-center mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Build your B2B organic pipeline</h2>
      <p class="mb-6" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Start with a free audit to identify your biggest B2B SEO opportunities.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/audit/" class="btn-gold">Get a Free Audit</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-secondary">Request a Strategy Call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
